---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer
  class="mt-auto border-t transition-colors"
  style="background-color: var(--bg-surface); border-color: var(--border-subtle);"
>
  <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 pb-6 border-b" style="border-color: var(--border-subtle);">
      <div class="space-y-2">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span
            class="w-7 h-7 rounded-md flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"
            style="background-color: var(--accent-surface); border: 1px solid var(--accent-border);"
          >
            <svg
              class="w-3.5 h-3.5"
              style="color: var(--accent-text);"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              aria-hidden="true"
            >
              <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z" />
              <path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4" />
            </svg>
          </span>
          <span class="text-sm font-bold" style="color: var(--text-primary);">AmanDok</span>
        </div>
        <p
          class="text-xs leading-relaxed"
          style="color: var(--text-secondary);"
          data-i18n-id="Studio privasi dokumen 100% lokal (Zero-Upload). Dirancang untuk mengamankan KTP, KK, dan ijazah sebelum dikirim secara daring."
          data-i18n-en="100% local (Zero-Upload) document privacy studio. Built to protect ID cards, certificates, and forms before sharing online."
        >
          Studio privasi dokumen 100% lokal (Zero-Upload). Dirancang untuk mengamankan KTP, KK, dan ijazah sebelum dikirim secara daring.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-2">
        <h2
          class="text-xs font-bold"
          style="color: var(--text-primary);"
          data-i18n-id="Jaminan Privasi Lokal"
          data-i18n-en="Local Privacy Guarantees"
        >
          Jaminan Privasi Lokal
        </h2>
        <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-xs" style="color: var(--text-secondary);">
          <li
            data-i18n-id="Nol byte gambar dikirim atau disimpan di server."
            data-i18n-en="Zero image bytes are sent to or stored on any server."
          >
            Nol byte gambar dikirim atau disimpan di server.
          </li>
          <li
            data-i18n-id="Metadata kamera dan koordinat GPS EXIF dibersihkan saat ekspor."
            data-i18n-en="Camera EXIF and GPS coordinates are stripped on export."
          >
            Metadata kamera dan koordinat GPS EXIF dibersihkan saat ekspor.
          </li>
          <li
            data-i18n-id="Sensor piksel dan watermark menyatu permanen menjadi piksel datar."
            data-i18n-en="Redaction boxes and watermarks are flattened permanently into pixels."
          >
            Sensor piksel dan watermark menyatu permanen menjadi piksel datar.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-2">
        <h2
          class="text-xs font-bold"
          style="color: var(--text-primary);"
          data-i18n-id="Ekosistem Terkait"
          data-i18n-en="Related Tools"
        >
          Ekosistem Terkait
        </h2>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-1 text-xs">
          <a
            href="/"
            class="inline-flex items-center min-h-[44px] font-medium hover:underline"
            style="color: var(--accent-text);"
            data-i18n-id="Buka Studio AmanDok"
            data-i18n-en="Open AmanDok Studio"
          >
            Buka Studio AmanDok
          </a>
          <a
            href="https://gaji.ritonga.ai.id"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center min-h-[44px] hover:underline"
            style="color: var(--text-secondary);"
            data-i18n-id="Kalkulator Gaji Bersih & PPh 21"
            data-i18n-en="Indonesia Net Salary & PPh 21 Calculator"
          >
            Kalkulator Gaji Bersih & PPh 21
          </a>
          <a
            href="https://ritonga.ai.id"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center min-h-[44px] hover:underline"
            style="color: var(--text-secondary);"
            data-i18n-id="Portofolio Yohannes C. Ritonga"
            data-i18n-en="Yohannes C. Ritonga Portfolio"
          >
            Portofolio Yohannes C. Ritonga
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div
      class="pt-5 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-3 text-xs"
      style="color: var(--text-muted);"
    >
      <p
        data-i18n-id={`© ${currentYear} AmanDok. Bebas pelacak dan 100% di peramban.`}
        data-i18n-en={`© ${currentYear} AmanDok. Tracker-free and 100% in your browser.`}
      >
        © {currentYear} AmanDok. Bebas pelacak dan 100% di peramban.
      </p>
      <p>
        <span
          data-i18n-id="Dibangun oleh "
          data-i18n-en="Engineered by "
        >
          Dibangun oleh{' '}
        </span>
        <a
          href="https://ritonga.ai.id"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="font-semibold hover:underline"
          style="color: var(--text-primary);"
        >
          Yohannes C. Ritonga
        </a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
